      "message": "Chris can clarify if I\u0027ve forgotten something, but I believe we didn\u0027t include `hdrs` due to:\n\n1. lack of globs resulting in extremely large BUILD files -- this seems doable to contend with\n2. `include_dirs` (as opposed to `local_include_dirs`) resulted in globs from other packages --  this something we had planned on contending with post-migration by deprecating `include_dirs` to instead use `cc_header_library` targets in those cases.\n\nAgreed that the information may be available -- or may be something we could consider consolidating, similar to the consolidation Colin did for llndk a year or so ago.\n\nAgreed as well that it may be nice to consolidate on a single target for these eventually, that can be a longer term goal.",
